flocate is a forensic extension of plocate (https://plocate.sesse.net/):
a locate based on posting lists whose updatedb additionally records
per-file metadata, optional content hashes and a change history, plus the
companion tool flocate-showdiff to replay, diff and verify that data.

Build instructions, configuration and day-to-day usage are documented in
README.md (English) and README_de.md (German).

